From: hj at jhu.edu (Harris A. Jaffee)
Date: Tue, 6 May 2014 16:46:35 -0400
Subject: [BioC] How to do a Vlookup-type function using a value range
In-Reply-To: <CA+bALxgK_+h7AWQTgCHVC=4LD-DLLG_OF3_t4HS+jaTWo6pLXA@mail.gmail.com>
References: <CA+bALxgK_+h7AWQTgCHVC=4LD-DLLG_OF3_t4HS+jaTWo6pLXA@mail.gmail.com>
Message-ID: <B34C5210-1A55-47B3-A101-14819C75126E@jhu.edu>

If X and Y are your data frames, the rows you want are given by

	library(IRanges) 

	nearest(IRanges(X[,"Position"], width=1), IRanges(start=Y[,"Start"], end=Y[,"Stop"]))



