References: <CABDO+Vfq6URd+hK3smh0wMOy=QLGEy_iedKPF=wVSBF0r=1Aeg@mail.gmail.com>
Message-ID: <537A1693.9030701@upf.edu>

hi Daniel, i hope you don't mind i carbon copy the Bioconductor mailing 
list, as this problem you have may occur to other people who want to use 
VariantFiltering and in this way they'll find the answer if they google 
for this same question.

the problem you are reporting below comes from the fact that you are 
using Bioconductor 2.13 bound to R version 3.0.2 while VariantFiltering 
only entered the latest release of Bioconductor 2.14 which is bound to R 
version 3.1.0, and therefore, it does not exist in previous releases of 
Bioconductor.

